{"id": "u19", "config": "fixed:sarvam-105b-conversations", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:sarvam-105b-conversations", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "sarvam-105b-conversations", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 71, "out_tokens": 202, "cost_inr": 0.00576, "latency_ms": 476.3, "attempts": [{"model": "sarvam-105b-conversations", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 71, "out_tokens": 202, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cost_inr": 0.00576, "latency_s": 0.476}], "reasoning_tokens": 0, "answer": "I need to find the simple interest for each option and compare them.\n\n**Simple Interest Formula:** SI = P × R × T / 100\n\n**Option A:**\n- P = 2,00,000, R = 6.5%, T = 1 year\n- SI = 2,00,000 × 6.5 × 1 / 100 = 13,000\n\n**Option B:**\n- P = 2,00,000, R = 7%, T = 1 year\n- SI = 2,00,000 × 7 × 1 / 100 = 14,000\n\n**Comparison:**\n- Difference = 14,000 − 13,000 = 1,000\n\nOption B, Rs 1,000 more.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u20", "config": "fixed:sarvam-105b-conversations", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "hi", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:sarvam-105b-conversations", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "sarvam-105b-conversations", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 68, "out_tokens": 186, "cost_inr": 0.00533, "latency_ms": 583.0, "attempts": [{"model": "sarvam-105b-conversations", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 68, "out_tokens": 186, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cost_inr": 0.00533, "latency_s": 0.583}], "reasoning_tokens": 0, "answer": "लोन B, ₹1500 सस्ता। \n\n**कारण:** \nसाधारण ब्याज (SI) = (मूलधन × दर × समय) / 100\n* लोन A का ब्याज = (1,00,000 × 9 × 1) / 100 = ₹9,000\n* लोन B का ब्याज = (1,00,000 × 10.5 × 1) / 100 = ₹10,500\n\nलोन A (₹9,000) का ब्याज लोन B (₹10,500) से कम है। दोनों के बीच का अंतर ₹1,500 है, इसलिए लोन A सस्ता है। \n\n(नोट: आपके निर्देशानुसार उत्तर का प्रारूप: **लोन A, ₹1500 सस्ता।**)", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u21", "config": "fixed:sarvam-105b-conversations", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:sarvam-105b-conversations", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "sarvam-105b-conversations", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 63, "out_tokens": 508, "cost_inr": 0.01333, "latency_ms": 1064.2, "attempts": [{"model": "sarvam-105b-conversations", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 63, "out_tokens": 508, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cost_inr": 0.01333, "latency_s": 1.064}], "reasoning_tokens": 0, "answer": "I need to compare the total interest earned from both options over 2 years.\n\n## Given Information\n- Principal (P) = Rs 1,00,000\n- Time (T) = 2 years\n\n---\n\n## Option A: Simple Interest at 7%\n\n**Formula:** Simple Interest = P × R × T / 100\n\n$$\\text{SI} = \\frac{1,00,000 \\times 7 \\times 2}{100} = \\frac{14,00,000}{100} = \\text{Rs } 14,000$$\n\n**Total Amount = 1,00,000 + 14,000 = Rs 1,14,000**\n\n---\n\n## Option B: Compound Interest at 6.8% (compounded yearly)\n\n**Formula:** A = P(1 + R/100)^T\n\n$$\\text{Amount} = 1,00,000 \\times \\left(1 + \\frac{6.8}{100}\\right)^2 = 1,00,000 \\times (1.068)^2$$\n\n$$(1.068)^2 = 1.140624$$\n\n$$\\text{Amount} = 1,00,000 \\times 1.140624 = \\text{Rs } 1,14,062.40$$\n\n**Compound Interest = 1,14,062.40 − 1,00,000 = Rs 14,062.40**\n\n---\n\n## Comparison\n\n| Option | Interest Earned |\n|--------|-----------------|\n| A (Simple) | Rs 14,000.00 |\n| B (Compound) | Rs 14,062.40 |\n\n**Option B gives more interest.**\n\n**Difference = 14,062.40 − 14,000.00 = Rs 62.40**\n\n---\n\n## Answer\n\n**Option B (6.8% compounded yearly) gives more interest by Rs 62** (to the nearest rupee).", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u22", "config": "fixed:sarvam-105b-conversations", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "pa", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:sarvam-105b-conversations", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "sarvam-105b-conversations", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 53, "out_tokens": 246, "cost_inr": 0.00668, "latency_ms": 670.8, "attempts": [{"model": "sarvam-105b-conversations", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 53, "out_tokens": 246, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cost_inr": 0.00668, "latency_s": 0.671}], "reasoning_tokens": 0, "answer": "₹2,00,000 ਦੇ ਕਰਜ਼ੇ ਲਈ 11% ਸਾਲਾਨਾ ਵਿਆਜ ਅਤੇ 36 ਮਹੀਨਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਸਮੇਂ 'ਤੇ EMI ਦਾ ਹਿਸਾਬ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਲੱਗੇਗਾ:\n\n* ਮੂਲ ਰਕਮ (Principal): ₹2,00,000\n* ਸਾਲਾਨਾ ਵਿਆਜ ਦਰ: 11%\n* ਮਹੀਨਾਵਾਰ ਵਿਆਜ ਦਰ: 11% / 12 = 0.9167%\n* ਸਮਾਂ (Tenure): 36 ਮਹੀਨੇ\n\nEMI ਦਾ ਫਾਰਮੂਲਾ: [P × r × (1+r)^n] / [(1+r)^n - 1]\n\nਇਸ ਫਾਰਮੂਲੇ ਵਿੱਚ ਮੁੱਲ ਭਰਨ 'ਤੇ:\nEMI = [200000 × 0.009167 × (1 + 0.009167)^36] / [(1 + 0.009167)^36 - 1]\nEMI ≈ ₹6,592.38\n\nਇਸ ਲਈ, ਤੁਹਾਡੀ ਮਹੀਨਾਵਾਰ EMI ਲਗਭਗ ₹6,592.38 ਬਣੇਗੀ।\n\n6592.38", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
